OL,3,GNEWSA'Warrior' baby home after 304 days
OL,4,Ain hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby who spent 304 days in hospital
OL,7,Fbattling three heart conditions,
OL,8,Fmultiple strokes and having several
OL,9,Fsurgeries has finally been allowed
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FMilo, who was born at just 27 weeks,
OL,13,Fhas been described as a "pure warrior"
OL,14,Fby his mum Laura, who credits staff at
OL,15,FBristol Children's Hospital with saving
OL,16,Fthe 10-month-old's life multiple times.
OL,18,F"There is hope, I've done so many days
OL,19,Fof wanting to give up... I just want to
OL,20,Fprove you can be in NICU, PICU, on the
OL,21,Fward for 304 days and your baby can
OL,22,Fcome home," Laura said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
